<title>POLAND: KPW clears Mostostal Gdansk new issue.</title>
<headline>KPW clears Mostostal Gdansk new issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) has cleared for public trade a new issue of Mostostal Gdansk SA, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p> Tranches		  No Of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Open tranche	     150,000		 June 30 - July 7</p>
<p> Closed tranche	 1,250,000		 June 30 - July 1</p>
<p> Lead Manager:	   Creditanstalt Securities SA</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	capital investments, machinary purchase</p>
<p> EARNINGS DATA	   1996		     1995</p>
<p>(in million of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:	     2.19		    1.43</p>
<p> Sales:		   93.40		   59.25</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p>Elektrim - 12 percent of shares</p>
<p>Polish Pioneer mutual fund - eight percent of shares</p>
<p>No of existing shares: 2,600,000</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
